  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read `src/client/pcf/CommunicationActions/` in full (manifest, action wiring, `@spaarke/auth` boundary, solution), the task-060 compose box + `communicationTimelineApi.sendMessage`, task-051's outbound send endpoint contract, and `src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md`.</step>
    <step order="2">§11 decision: determine whether to EXTEND `CommunicationActions` (preferred) or create a new `CommunicationMessageActions` control. Record the three-question answer. Proceed with the chosen path.</step>
    <step order="3">Implement the send/respond actions: compose (new message), send, respond (reply into the current thread). Wire each to the BFF outbound send path (task 051) via the `@spaarke/auth`-built `authenticatedFetch`; the channel is Message (server dispatches by `sprk_communicationtype`). Reuse the compose surface from 060.</step>
    <step order="4">Ensure ADR-022 platform libraries in the manifest (React 16/17; no React 18 bundled) and Fluent v9 styling. Grep the produced bundle for `@azure/communication` — MUST be absent (NFR-04).</step>
    <step order="5">Run `npm run build:prod` (NOT `npm run build` — AP-1). Resolve manifest/type errors.</step>
    <step order="6">Pack + deploy via `pcf-deploy`; place the accessory on the OOB `sprk_communication`/thread main form alongside the timeline (061) and email-r4 accessories. Document form/section placement. (If the environment blocks import, package + validate the ZIP and hand the `pac solution import` + form-config remainder to the owner — mirror email-r4 task 043.)</step>
    <step order="7">Verify compose/send/respond function from the OOB form with no Code Page host and no FCC swap (UI tests below).</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` (focus: platform libraries, no React 18 bundled, no ACS SDK, auth at boundary only, composer reused not cloned, §11 extend-vs-new justification); `adr-check` against ADR-022/006/026/028/021 + `spec.md` (FR-12, NFR-04). Address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (062 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record decisions (extend-vs-new choice + rationale, form placement, send-path wiring to 051).</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="read">CommunicationActions PCF, task-060 compose box, task-051 send endpoint, PCF CLAUDE.md</tool>
